snippet.description:
Sonic Origins Ultrafix is back! This new update will feature a variety of new features, including all new tracks newly arranged and composed for Sonic 3 as well as changes to sprites, stages, and sound!

This version will be released alongside the start of the Sonic Hacking Contest, but you can download the previous version here.
https://gamebanana.com/mods/452036

